title: 'pallet-elections-phragmen: slash kicked members to `Config::KickedMember`'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    The deposit slashed from a member removed with `remove_member` and `slash_bond = true` is now
    handed to `Config::KickedMember`. It was handed to `Config::LoserCandidate` instead, and
    `KickedMember` was never called. Runtimes that configure different handlers for the two will
    see these funds arrive at a different destination.
crates:
- name: pallet-elections-phragmen
  bump: patch
